  "name": "Lyo.Mathematics",
  "area": "Core",
  "tagline": "C# contracts for the Lyo math stack: physical quantities as structs, 2D/3D vectors and small matrices, typed inputs/results for formulas, and a small registry for discoverability.",
  "description": "C# contracts for the Lyo math stack: physical quantities as structs, 2D/3D vectors and small matrices, typed inputs/results for formulas, and a small registry for\ndiscoverability. Numerical implementations live in [`Lyo.Mathematics.Functions`](../Lyo.Mathematics.Functions/README.md) (F#).\n\nTarget frameworks: `netstandard2.0`, `net10.0`",
